  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards resilient and adaptive education systems in Eastern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pandemic and other natural and human-induced disasters affected Education systems of countries in Eastern Africa exacerbat existing challenges in teaching and learning and in meeting SDG 4 commitments. Even where technology was deployed to deliver education, teacher capacities were not sufficient to effectively utilize the technologies in teaching, learning and assessment and gender digital gap still need to be addressed.
UNESCO Nairobi will support the review ofEducation Policies in countries to strenghten resilience and equity education systems to flexibly respond to evolving learning environments and to better deliver on SDG4 commitments in Eastern Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
